  "baldwin hills scenic overlook description: this public campfire program is set at baldwin hills scenic overlook\u2019s amphitheater area, overlooking the city below. the event is co-led by a park interpreter and our park partners, nature nexus institute. our special guestfranklin, from motherland music, will be leading us in a storytime drum circle.embrace the rhythm of the fall harvest, where the beats of drumming echo the bounty of the season, reminding us that just as nature\u2019s cycles bring forth abundance, music unites us in celebration and gratitude. there will be family-friendly activities and interactions, a guided nature stroll, and delicious s\u2019more-making. our campfires are a fantastic opportunity to enjoy and learn about nature and history within our city. join us as we make lasting memories with family and friends and bring the community together in a safe and inclusive space. every 3rd saturday of the month!(minors are required to be accompanied by parent or guardian).": null,
  "malibu creek sp, california": null,
  "main trailhead parking lot description of event: join a malibu creek docent for an easy nature walk along the creek and under the oak trees. we'll talk about the animals and plants found in the mountains, plus the park's unique history, including its movie making past. there's something for everyone in this 2 1/2 hour walk, whether you are a first time visitor or a seasoned park enthusiast. families are welcome. we'll meet at 10am in the park's main trailhead parking lot (second, lower lot) by the restrooms. no reservation required. rain cancels event. no dogs. questions can be sent to info@malibucreekstatepark.org": null,
  "los angeles state historic park welcome pavillion 1315 n. spring street los angeles, ca 90012 free entry. no registration or rsvp needed.": null,
  "near the south lawn of los angeles state historic park description of event: gather near the la river farmers\u2019 market and grab a book from our community book cart to read and enjoy. have some literature to spare? drop it off for the next avid reader!": null,
  "los angeles state historic park 1279 n spring st los angeles, ca 90012": null,
  "malibu lagoon sb, california": null,
  "baldwin hills scenic overlook description of event: join us for a habitat restoration event! it\u2019s a great opportunity to learn about native plants and local wildlife, all while spending some time outdoors in beautiful baldwin hills parklands. this event is in partnership with california state parks foundation.": null,
  "rio de los angeles state park description: join community members and help the park with their ongoing habitat restoration efforts! volunteers will use hand tools to remove invasive plants, mulch, and provide general plant care to ensure recently planted native species continue to thrive. this project will protect critical habitat for pollinators and other wildlife. ages 8 and over welcome (minors must be accompanied by an adult and bring a waiver signed by their guardian). full opportunity address and directions will be sent to you by e-mail after you sign up.": null,
